      <section id="schemas">
        <h2>Schemas and OpenAPI</h2>
        <p>The commercial contract is generated from the canonical API's OpenAPI plus the entitlement config, so data schemas (<code>MetricObject</code>, <code>StanceSplit</code>, <code>DnaSnapshot</code>, <code>MatchupDna</code>, <code>Video</code>, <code>PrimaryImage</code>, envelopes) are byte-identical to upstream and every operation carries <code>x-plan</code> and <code>x-origin</code>. Servers: <code>https://ufc.proptechusa.ai</code> (commercial) and <code>https://ufc-api.propbetedge.ai</code> (canonical, first-party). Import <a href="/openapi.json">openapi.json</a> into your client generator, or browse the <a href="/docs/reference">interactive reference</a>.</p>
      </section>
